12 BUGS
*******

We welcome bug reports in the hledger issue tracker
(https://bugs.hledger.org), or on the hledger chat or mail list
(https://hledger.org/support).

   Some known issues:

   Without JavaScript (eg in text-mode browsers), pages can be viewed
and their links followed, but the add form, help dialog, keyboard
shortcuts, sidebar toggle and folding don't work.


